        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Molly Windsor, Samantha Morton, Nicole Taylor, Philippa Lowthorpe\n- Works: The Unloved, Three Girls\n- Organizations: BBC One, BAFTA\n- Places: Nottingham\n\nFacts:\n- Molly Windsor was born on 19 June 1997.\n- Molly Windsor is an English actress from Nottingham.\n- Molly Windsor is best known for starring as Lucy Manvers in the 2009 BAFTA-winning television film The Unloved.\n- Samantha Morton directed the television film The Unloved.\n- Three Girls is a three-part British television drama series.\n- Nicole Taylor wrote Three Girls.\n- Philippa Lowthorpe directed Three Girls.\n- Three Girls broadcast on BBC One on three consecutive nights from 16 to 18 May 2017.\n- Molly Windsor is also known for starring in the 2017 BBC TV series Three Girls.",
